'''Discover Pokémon Together''' is a series of {{pkmn|animation|animated}} shorts released directly on the official [[Pokémon]] [[YouTube]] channel, each focusing on a different Pokémon. In addition to the animated shorts, the Pokémon focused on in the video would receive a sheet with some details about it on the Pokémon website and a video in the [[Beyond the Pokédex]] series about it (also hosted on the YouTube channel).

