==''Lechonk''==
{{YouTubeEmbed|wJSV8Jisrus|Pokemon|color={{colorschemelight|Hoso}}|colorlight={{colorschemelight|Hoso}}|colordark={{colorschemedark|Hoso}}}}

===Summary===
A narrator comments about Lechonk's abilities, namely its sense of adventure, senstive snout, immense strength, and sense of taste as it sniffs around for food, before noticing many [[Occa Berry|Occa Berries]] in a tree above it. It headbutts the tree, causing the berries to fall down. Later, after having eaten the berries, Lechonk is asleep. The narrator accidentally wakes up Lechonk, and it runs off.

